{"text": "PHILIP MORRIS INTERNATIONAL INC.\n\nINTER-OFFICE CORRESPONDENCE\n\nTo:\n\nFROM:\n\n\u2018800 WESTCHESTER AVENUE, RYE BROOK, NEW YORK 10573-1301\n\nRoger Whidden\n\nLeslie Greher\n\nSUBJECT: Pack Of Fewer Than 20 Cigarettes\n\nDATE: January 27, 1998\n\nPer your request, the following is a list of markets in which we sell cigarettes in packs of fewer than 20\nslicks. [These are mainly 10's packs but include also 15's, 14\u2019s, 8's and 7's in specific markets.]\n\nEU Asia Mercosur ANCAM Japan\nBelgium Brunei \u2018Argentina \u2018Aruba Japan\nDenmark Cambodia Brazil\nFinland India Uruguay\nFrance Korea Ecuador\nitaly Malaysia El Salvador\nNorway Maldives Guatemala\nSpain Myanmar Mexico\n\u2018Sweden Pakistan Panama\nPhilippines Paraguay\nSingapore Peru\nTaiwan Puerto Rico\nVietnam Venezuela\n\n{In addition to the markets listed, we sell packs of 19 sticks in Germany where this is considered to be\nthe standard size \u2014i.., in lieu of 20's. On occasion, based on cigarette price changes, we sell packs\nin German vending machines that may contain 17 or 18 sticks \u2014 or more than 20 \u2014 in order to have a\nround coinage price. These vending packs are not available in stores. When prices change again,\n\nthe stick count in vending is changed accordingly.]\n\ncc: A. Daw\n\nt9tsvessoz", "words": [{"text": "PHILIP", "x0": 83, "y0": 119, "x1": 124, "y1": 129, "conf": 95.0}, {"text": "MORRIS", "x0": 128, "y0": 119, "x1": 179, "y1": 130, "conf": 90.0}, {"text": "INTERNATIONAL", "x0": 183, "y0": 119, "x1": 287, "y1": 130, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "INC.", "x0": 291, "y0": 120, "x1": 316, "y1": 130, "conf": 93.0}, {"text": "INTER-OFFICE", "x0": 439, "y0": 119, "x1": 528, "y1": 129, "conf": 90.0}, {"text": "CORRESPONDENCE", "x0": 533, "y0": 119, "x1": 660, "y1": 129, "conf": 94.0}, {"text": "To:", "x0": 82, "y0": 170, "x1": 104, "y1": 180, "conf": 93.0}, {"text": "FROM:", "x0": 83, "y0": 201, "x1": 124, "y1": 211, "conf": 95.0}, {"text": "\u2018800", "x0": 246, "y